    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 150 of the Inland Revenue Act, No.24 of 2017 KHUHLQDIWHU\u0003UHIHUUHG\u0003WR\u0003DV\u0003WKH\u0003\u00b3SULQFLSDO\u0003HQDFWPHQW\u00b4 \u0003DQG\u0003WKH\u0003OHJDO\u0003H\u0d75HFW\u0003RI\u0003WKDW\u0003VHFWLRQ\u0003as amended is to reduce the time period within which a refund may be requested by a tax payer, from four years to two and a half years.",
